---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "June 21, 2025";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="TeeMockup Privacy Policy — learn how we handle your data. We don't collect, upload, or store any of your designs or personal information. Everything runs in-browser."
  canonical="https://freeteemockup.com/privacy"
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="page-breadcrumb-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="page-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="lc" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-meta">
        <span>
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
          Last updated: {lastUpdated}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="page-content">
    <div class="prose">

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong>Short version:</strong> TeeMockup runs entirely in your browser. We do not collect, upload, or store your designs, artwork, or any personal information. No account is required to use the tool.
      </div>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        1. Who We Are
      </h2>
      <p>TeeMockup ("we", "us", "our") is a free browser-based t-shirt mockup generation tool available at <a href="https://freeteemockup.com">freeteemockup.com</a>. We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring a safe, transparent experience.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        2. Information We Collect
      </h2>
      <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>When you use the Contact Us form, you may provide your name, email address, and a message. This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and is not shared with third parties.</p>

      <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>Like most websites, we may automatically collect basic technical information when you visit, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Referring URL</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
        <li>IP address (anonymized where possible)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This information is collected via standard server logs and analytics tools and is used only for site performance analysis and improvement.</p>

      <h3>2.3 Your Designs and Artwork</h3>
      <p><strong>We do not collect, upload, transmit, or store any artwork, images, or design files you use in TeeMockup.</strong> All image processing — including background removal, color application, and mockup rendering — occurs entirely within your browser using the HTML5 Canvas API. Your files never leave your device.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
        3. How We Use Your Information
      </h2>
      <p>Any information we collect is used exclusively to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to contact form inquiries</li>
        <li>Monitor and improve site performance</li>
        <li>Diagnose technical issues</li>
        <li>Analyse usage trends to guide feature development</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        4. Cookies
      </h2>
      <p>We may use cookies or similar technologies for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — required for basic site functionality</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — anonymous usage data to understand how visitors interact with the site (e.g. Google Analytics, if used)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can control or disable cookies via your browser settings. Disabling cookies will not affect your ability to use the TeeMockup editor.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
        5. Third-Party Services
      </h2>
      <p>TeeMockup may use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — for typography (Outfit font). Google may set cookies or collect data per their <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics provider</strong> — for anonymous usage analytics. No personal data is shared.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not share your data with advertisers or data brokers.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"/><line x1="4" y1="22" x2="4" y2="15"/></svg>
        6. Your Rights
      </h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Right to access the data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Right to correct inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Right to request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Right to object to processing</li>
        <li>Right to data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@freeteemockup.com">contact@freeteemockup.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
        7. Children's Privacy
      </h2>
      <p>TeeMockup is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="1 4 1 10 7 10"/><path d="M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 .49-3.65"/></svg>
        8. Changes to This Policy
      </h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of TeeMockup after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        9. Contact Us
      </h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@freeteemockup.com">contact@freeteemockup.com</a></li>
        <li>Contact form: <a href="/contact">freeteemockup.com/contact</a></li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </div>

</PageLayout>
